{"id":"overnight-2026-08-15","parent":"lanes","ord":"a6","title":"Overnight run, 2026-08-15 — the standing orders","desc":"Ruled by the human before bed. THE SIX: html-images, html-frame-height, watcher-postboot-blind, suite-load-flakes (on a kolu-ci-* box), outlines-quadratic, html-memory. SCHEDULE: 3 Opus authors max at a time (search-props-ui holds a slot until it closes); the three HTML items serialize as a chain (frame-height → images → memory) because they share code; watcher and outlines are independent; flakes dispatches to kolu-ci-1 when a slot frees. RULES: grok+opencode review every PR; merges on the orchestrator's judgment — routine leftovers are filed on the roadmap, may be dispatched as follow-ups, and the PR merges; anything needing human eyes stays OPEN with notes. suite-load-flakes may legitimately end as a diagnosis + reproducer rather than a merged PR. The Bun bump (bun-watcher-bump) stays the human's — briefed into the watcher lane. Every lane walks the dag-pr template; evidence is verified before any merge.","created":"2026-08-15T20:57:08-04:00"}
